{"page":274,"verses":[{"verse_key":"16:65","surah":16,"ayah":65,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ أَنزَلَ مِنَ ٱلسَّمَآءِ مَآءً فَأَحْيَا بِهِ ٱلْأَرْضَ بَعْدَ مَوْتِهَآ ۚ إِنَّ فِى ذَٰلِكَ لَـَٔايَةً لِّقَوْمٍ يَسْمَعُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It is God who sends water down from the sky and with it revives the earth when it is dead. There truly is a sign in this for people who listen.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"16:65"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَنزَلَ","en_gloss":"has sent down","transliteration":"anzala","verse_key":"16:65"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"16:65"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","en_gloss":"the sky","transliteration":"l-samāi","verse_key":"16:65"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَآءًۭ","en_gloss":"water","transliteration":"māan","verse_key":"16:65"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَأَحْيَا","en_gloss":"then gives life","transliteration":"fa-aḥyā","verse_key":"16:65"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِهِ","en_gloss":"by it","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"16:65"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضَ","en_gloss":"(to) the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍa","verse_key":"16:65"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بَعْدَ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"baʿda","verse_key":"16:65"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مَوْتِهَآ ۚ","en_gloss":"its death","transliteration":"mawtihā","verse_key":"16:65"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"16:65"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"16:65"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"16:65"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لَـَٔايَةًۭ","en_gloss":"(is) surely a Sign","transliteration":"laāyatan","verse_key":"16:65"},{"pos":15,"ar":"لِّقَوْمٍۢ","en_gloss":"for a people","transliteration":"liqawmin","verse_key":"16:65"},{"pos":16,"ar":"يَسْمَعُونَ","en_gloss":"who listen","transliteration":"yasmaʿūna","verse_key":"16:65"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٦٥","en_gloss":"(65)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:65"}]},{"verse_key":"16:66","surah":16,"ayah":66,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِنَّ لَكُمْ فِى ٱلْأَنْعَـٰمِ لَعِبْرَةً ۖ نُّسْقِيكُم مِّمَّا فِى بُطُونِهِۦ مِنۢ بَيْنِ فَرْثٍ وَدَمٍ لَّبَنًا خَالِصًا سَآئِغًا لِّلشَّـٰرِبِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"In livestock, too, you have a lesson- We give you a drink from the contents of their bellies, between waste matter and blood, pure milk, sweet to the drinker.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِنَّ","en_gloss":"And indeed","transliteration":"wa-inna","verse_key":"16:66"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَكُمْ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"16:66"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"16:66"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْأَنْعَـٰمِ","en_gloss":"the cattle","transliteration":"l-anʿāmi","verse_key":"16:66"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَعِبْرَةًۭ ۖ","en_gloss":"(is) a lesson","transliteration":"laʿib'ratan","verse_key":"16:66"},{"pos":6,"ar":"نُّسْقِيكُم","en_gloss":"We give you to drink","transliteration":"nus'qīkum","verse_key":"16:66"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِّمَّا","en_gloss":"from what","transliteration":"mimmā","verse_key":"16:66"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"16:66"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بُطُونِهِۦ","en_gloss":"their bellies","transliteration":"buṭūnihi","verse_key":"16:66"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِنۢ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"16:66"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بَيْنِ","en_gloss":"between","transliteration":"bayni","verse_key":"16:66"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فَرْثٍۢ","en_gloss":"bowels","transliteration":"farthin","verse_key":"16:66"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَدَمٍۢ","en_gloss":"and blood","transliteration":"wadamin","verse_key":"16:66"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لَّبَنًا","en_gloss":"milk","transliteration":"labanan","verse_key":"16:66"},{"pos":15,"ar":"خَالِصًۭا","en_gloss":"pure","transliteration":"khāliṣan","verse_key":"16:66"},{"pos":16,"ar":"سَآئِغًۭا","en_gloss":"palatable","transliteration":"sāighan","verse_key":"16:66"},{"pos":17,"ar":"لِّلشَّـٰرِبِينَ","en_gloss":"to the drinkers","transliteration":"lilshāribīna","verse_key":"16:66"},{"pos":18,"ar":"٦٦","en_gloss":"(66)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:66"}]},{"verse_key":"16:67","surah":16,"ayah":67,"ar_uthmani":"وَمِن ثَمَرَٰتِ ٱلنَّخِيلِ وَٱلْأَعْنَـٰبِ تَتَّخِذُونَ مِنْهُ سَكَرًا وَرِزْقًا حَسَنًا ۗ إِنَّ فِى ذَٰلِكَ لَـَٔايَةً لِّقَوْمٍ يَعْقِلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"From the fruits of date palms and grapes you take sweet juice and wholesome provisions. There truly is a sign in this for people who use their reason.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمِن","en_gloss":"And from","transliteration":"wamin","verse_key":"16:67"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ثَمَرَٰتِ","en_gloss":"fruits","transliteration":"thamarāti","verse_key":"16:67"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلنَّخِيلِ","en_gloss":"the date-palm","transliteration":"l-nakhīli","verse_key":"16:67"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَٱلْأَعْنَـٰبِ","en_gloss":"and the grapes","transliteration":"wal-aʿnābi","verse_key":"16:67"},{"pos":5,"ar":"تَتَّخِذُونَ","en_gloss":"you take","transliteration":"tattakhidhūna","verse_key":"16:67"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِنْهُ","en_gloss":"from it","transliteration":"min'hu","verse_key":"16:67"},{"pos":7,"ar":"سَكَرًۭا","en_gloss":"intoxicant","transliteration":"sakaran","verse_key":"16:67"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَرِزْقًا","en_gloss":"and a provision","transliteration":"wariz'qan","verse_key":"16:67"},{"pos":9,"ar":"حَسَنًا ۗ","en_gloss":"good","transliteration":"ḥasanan","verse_key":"16:67"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"16:67"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"16:67"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"16:67"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لَـَٔايَةًۭ","en_gloss":"(is) surely a Sign","transliteration":"laāyatan","verse_key":"16:67"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لِّقَوْمٍۢ","en_gloss":"for a people","transliteration":"liqawmin","verse_key":"16:67"},{"pos":15,"ar":"يَعْقِلُونَ","en_gloss":"who use reason","transliteration":"yaʿqilūna","verse_key":"16:67"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٦٧","en_gloss":"(67)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:67"}]},{"verse_key":"16:68","surah":16,"ayah":68,"ar_uthmani":"وَأَوْحَىٰ رَبُّكَ إِلَى ٱلنَّحْلِ أَنِ ٱتَّخِذِى مِنَ ٱلْجِبَالِ بُيُوتًا وَمِنَ ٱلشَّجَرِ وَمِمَّا يَعْرِشُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"And your Lord inspired the bee, saying, ‘Build yourselves houses in the mountains and trees and what people construct.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَأَوْحَىٰ","en_gloss":"And inspired","transliteration":"wa-awḥā","verse_key":"16:68"},{"pos":2,"ar":"رَبُّكَ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbuka","verse_key":"16:68"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِلَى","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"16:68"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلنَّحْلِ","en_gloss":"the bee","transliteration":"l-naḥli","verse_key":"16:68"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَنِ","en_gloss":"[that]","transliteration":"ani","verse_key":"16:68"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱتَّخِذِى","en_gloss":"Take","transliteration":"ittakhidhī","verse_key":"16:68"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"among","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"16:68"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْجِبَالِ","en_gloss":"the mountains","transliteration":"l-jibāli","verse_key":"16:68"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بُيُوتًۭا","en_gloss":"houses","transliteration":"buyūtan","verse_key":"16:68"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَمِنَ","en_gloss":"and among","transliteration":"wamina","verse_key":"16:68"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلشَّجَرِ","en_gloss":"the trees","transliteration":"l-shajari","verse_key":"16:68"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَمِمَّا","en_gloss":"and in what","transliteration":"wamimmā","verse_key":"16:68"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَعْرِشُونَ","en_gloss":"they construct","transliteration":"yaʿrishūna","verse_key":"16:68"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٦٨","en_gloss":"(68)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:68"}]},{"verse_key":"16:69","surah":16,"ayah":69,"ar_uthmani":"ثُمَّ كُلِى مِن كُلِّ ٱلثَّمَرَٰتِ فَٱسْلُكِى سُبُلَ رَبِّكِ ذُلُلًا ۚ يَخْرُجُ مِنۢ بُطُونِهَا شَرَابٌ مُّخْتَلِفٌ أَلْوَٰنُهُۥ فِيهِ شِفَآءٌ لِّلنَّاسِ ۗ إِنَّ فِى ذَٰلِكَ لَـَٔايَةً لِّقَوْمٍ يَتَفَكَّرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Then feed on all kinds of fruit and follow the ways made easy for you by your Lord.’ From their bellies comes a drink of different colours in which there is healing for people. There truly is a sign in this for those who think.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"Then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"16:69"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كُلِى","en_gloss":"eat","transliteration":"kulī","verse_key":"16:69"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"16:69"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كُلِّ","en_gloss":"all","transliteration":"kulli","verse_key":"16:69"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلثَّمَرَٰتِ","en_gloss":"the fruits","transliteration":"l-thamarāti","verse_key":"16:69"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَٱسْلُكِى","en_gloss":"and follow","transliteration":"fa-us'lukī","verse_key":"16:69"},{"pos":7,"ar":"سُبُلَ","en_gloss":"(the) ways","transliteration":"subula","verse_key":"16:69"},{"pos":8,"ar":"رَبِّكِ","en_gloss":"(of) your Lord","transliteration":"rabbiki","verse_key":"16:69"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ذُلُلًۭا ۚ","en_gloss":"made smooth","transliteration":"dhululan","verse_key":"16:69"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يَخْرُجُ","en_gloss":"Comes forth","transliteration":"yakhruju","verse_key":"16:69"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِنۢ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"16:69"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بُطُونِهَا","en_gloss":"their bellies","transliteration":"buṭūnihā","verse_key":"16:69"},{"pos":13,"ar":"شَرَابٌۭ","en_gloss":"a drink","transliteration":"sharābun","verse_key":"16:69"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مُّخْتَلِفٌ","en_gloss":"(of) varying","transliteration":"mukh'talifun","verse_key":"16:69"},{"pos":15,"ar":"أَلْوَٰنُهُۥ","en_gloss":"colors","transliteration":"alwānuhu","verse_key":"16:69"},{"pos":16,"ar":"فِيهِ","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhi","verse_key":"16:69"},{"pos":17,"ar":"شِفَآءٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) a healing","transliteration":"shifāon","verse_key":"16:69"},{"pos":18,"ar":"لِّلنَّاسِ ۗ","en_gloss":"for the mankin