,"verse_key":"16:71"}]},{"verse_key":"16:72","surah":16,"ayah":72,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ جَعَلَ لَكُم مِّنْ أَنفُسِكُمْ أَزْوَٰجًا وَجَعَلَ لَكُم مِّنْ أَزْوَٰجِكُم بَنِينَ وَحَفَدَةً وَرَزَقَكُم مِّنَ ٱلطَّيِّبَـٰتِ ۚ أَفَبِٱلْبَـٰطِلِ يُؤْمِنُونَ وَبِنِعْمَتِ ٱللَّهِ هُمْ يَكْفُرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"And it is God who has given you spouses from amongst yourselves and through them He has given you children and grandchildren and provided you with good things. How can they believe in falsehood and deny God’s blessings?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"16:72"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جَعَلَ","en_gloss":"(has) made","transliteration":"jaʿala","verse_key":"16:72"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَكُم","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"16:72"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِّنْ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"16:72"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَنفُسِكُمْ","en_gloss":"yourselves","transliteration":"anfusikum","verse_key":"16:72"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَزْوَٰجًۭا","en_gloss":"spouses","transliteration":"azwājan","verse_key":"16:72"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَجَعَلَ","en_gloss":"and has made","transliteration":"wajaʿala","verse_key":"16:72"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَكُم","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"16:72"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِّنْ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"16:72"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَزْوَٰجِكُم","en_gloss":"your spouses","transliteration":"azwājikum","verse_key":"16:72"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بَنِينَ","en_gloss":"sons","transliteration":"banīna","verse_key":"16:72"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَحَفَدَةًۭ","en_gloss":"and grandsons","transliteration":"waḥafadatan","verse_key":"16:72"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَرَزَقَكُم","en_gloss":"and has provided for you","transliteration":"warazaqakum","verse_key":"16:72"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"16:72"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلطَّيِّبَـٰتِ ۚ","en_gloss":"the good things","transliteration":"l-ṭayibāti